  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Last mile electrification support project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Overall Objective (Impact) of this project is to promote sustainable and social development in Uganda, in particular in peri-urban and rural areas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The specific objectives (Outcome) of this project is to increase the number of people and businesses using sustainable, clean and affordable energy services in the country, in particular in peri-urban and rural areas, with an attention on the reduction of gender inequalities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Main Outputs to be delivered by the project to contribute to these Specific Objectives are the construction (extension, densification &amp; rehabilitation) of distribution lines (main grid and minigrids) and connections.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The capacity of the ministry to carry electricity access projects will also be enhanced through capacity building.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
